{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 行为面试MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"项目上线后如何收集 Bad Case 并持续迭代？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"行为面试\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/行为面试\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">行为面试MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"项目上线后如何收集 Bad Case 并持续迭代？\" dir=\"auto\">项目上线后如何收集 Bad Case 并持续迭代？</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent 系统上线后，你如何发现和收集 Bad Case？如何持续优化系统？</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>一、Bad Case 收集 5 个渠道</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">BAD_CASE_CHANNELS <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 渠道 1: 用户反馈（点赞/点踩/举报）</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"user_feedback\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"trigger\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"用户点踩或举报\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"collection\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"自动记录对话上下文 + 模型输出\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 渠道 2: 人工审核抽样</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"manual_review\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"trigger\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"每日随机抽样 100 条对话\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"collection\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"标注员打分 + 问题分类\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 渠道 3: Golden Set 回归测试</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"golden_set\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"trigger\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"每日自动运行 500 条测试用例\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"collection\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"自动对比预期 vs 实际输出\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 渠道 4: 业务指标异常</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"metric_alert\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"trigger\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"满意度下降 / 转人工率上升\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"collection\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"关联分析找出问题对话\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 渠道 5: 用户主动反馈</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"proactive_feedback\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"trigger\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"用户主动报告错误\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"collection\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"反馈表单 + 对话记录\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>二、迭代优化流程</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">第 1 步: Bad Case 分类\n    ├── 意图识别错误\n    ├── RAG 检索错误\n    ├── 幻觉/编造\n    ├── 工具调用失败\n    ├── 格式不符合预期\n    └── 安全/合规问题\n\n第 2 步: 根因分析\n    ├── 数据问题（知识库过期、分片不合理）\n    ├── 模型问题（模型能力不足、温度参数不合适）\n    ├── Prompt 问题（指令不清晰、约束不够）\n    ├── 工程问题（超时、缓存失效）\n    └── 工具问题（API 变更、返回格式变化）\n\n第 3 步: 修复验证\n    ├── 修复方案（数据更新 / Prompt 优化 / 工程调整）\n    ├── 离线验证（Golden Set 测试）\n    ├── 灰度发布（5% 流量验证）\n    └── 全量发布（监控指标确认无回归）\n\n第 4 步: 效果评估\n    ├── 修复 Bad Case 的准确率\n    ├── 是否引入新问题（回归测试）\n    └── 业务指标变化（满意度、解决率）\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"优化后怎么确保没有引入新问题？\"</strong> — Golden Set 回归测试 + 灰度发布 + 多维指标监控</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"Bad Case 太多怎么排优先级？\"</strong> — 按影响面（发生频率 × 严重程度）排序</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">行为面试MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}